sleep 900
key tab
key tab
key space
sleep 500
type a
sleep 300
shot shots/01-adlib.png
key enter
sleep 1000
shot shots/02-restart.png
key esc
sleep 500
shot shots/03-added.png
key esc
sleep 300
shot shots/04-closed.png
quit
